<title>USA: Invacare says hearing on Healthdyne moved.</title>
<headline>Invacare says hearing on Healthdyne moved.</headline>
<dateline>ELYRIA, Ohio 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Invacare Corp said on Friday that July 17 had been set as the new hearing date in its litigation against Healthdyne Technologies Inc concerning a challenge to the &quot;dead-hand&quot; provisions of Healthdyne's poison pill.</p>
<p>The hearing date was previously set for July 16, but was moved to avoid a scheduling conflict at the District Court in Atlanta, Georgia.</p>
